Cell["\<\
The shift uses the arithmetic mean of the coordinates, with equal weight for \
every supplied site.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1908348388,ExpressionUUID->"6f596357-ddaa-3343-bc85-b809520a71c3"],

Cell[TextData[{
